{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24571","headline":"春日闲居三首 一 · 白居易","name":"春日闲居三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陶云爱吾庐，吾亦爱吾屋。\n屋中有琴书，聊以慰幽独。\n是时三月半，花落庭芜绿。\n舍上晨鸠鸣，窗间春睡足。\n睡足起闲坐，景晏方栉沐。\n今日非十斋，庖童馈鱼肉。\n饥来恣餐歠，冷热随所欲。\n饱竟快搔爬，筋骸无检束。\n岂徒畅肢体，兼欲遗耳目。\n便可傲松乔，何假杯中渌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}